  "totalBlocks": 39,
  "translatedBlocks": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78417ff1d109e51d",
      "translationZh": "作者：Dhruv Nathawani、Shuoyang Ding US、Vitaly Lavrukhin US、Jane Polak Scowcroft US、Oleksii Kuchaiev US",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c13edf348f37f325",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 继续发布采用宽松许可的数据集，以支持开放生态系统，此次推出的是 6 Million Multilingual Reasoning Dataset。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "070d7de2ed5ffb42",
      "translationZh": "继近期发布的 Nemotron Post-Training Dataset v1（用于 Llama Nemotron Super 模型）以及我们今年早些时候发布的 Llama Nemotron Post-Training Dataset 取得成功之后，我们很高兴发布翻译成五种目标语言的推理数据集：法语、西班牙语、德语、意大利语和日语。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a59ee9876a4b74b0",
      "translationZh": "新发布的 NVIDIA Nemotron Nano 2 9B 凭借混合 Transformer–Mamba 架构和可配置的思考预算，以领先的准确率和效率将这些能力带到边缘端，让你能够调节准确率、吞吐量和成本，以满足实际需求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a16ee0713e0ec203",
      "translationZh": "模型亮点（TL;DR）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2e103f2dfc4502f",
      "translationZh": "模型规模：9B 参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bf325b319f61f65",
      "translationZh": "架构：混合 Transformer–Mamba（Mamba‑2 + 少量注意力层），在准确率与同类纯 Transformer 模型相近的情况下实现更高吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95dea6f33c20e3fa",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量：词元生成吞吐量最高可达同等规模其他领先模型的 6 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d889a5062a72648",
      "translationZh": "成本：思考预算让你能够控制所使用的“思考”词元数量，将推理成本最多降低 60%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "759f97f810790183",
      "translationZh": "目标用途：客户服务智能体、客服聊天机器人、分析助手，以及边缘/RTX 部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f23f9bf3135240f",
      "translationZh": "可用性：模型权重已在 Hugging Face 上提供，你可以在 build.nvidia.com 上试用端点，该模型还将以 NVIDIA NIM 的形式提供，以实现高吞吐量和低延迟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f50a31fb7acec51a",
      "translationZh": "许可证：nvidia-open-model-license",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ed825e034a118e6",
      "translationZh": "此次发布标志着我们在持续致力于模型开发和改进的开放性与透明度方面迈出了重要一步。除训练工具和最终模型权重外，NVIDIA 还发布了训练数据，以支持开放权重模型的持续改进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d0f67e465817a086",
      "translationZh": "数据集包含什么，以及我们如何构建它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51427773eb5de2f7",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，Nemotron Post-Training Dataset V2 将我们此前发布的英语推理数据翻译成五种目标语言（法语、德语、意大利语、日语、西班牙语）。为了充分利用预训练期间注入的英语知识，我们翻译用户提示和模型回复，同时保留原始的英语推理链。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bc557d02fe9c588",
      "translationZh": "根据 WMT 2024 通用翻译共享任务的结果，LLM 在机器翻译任务中正取得当前最先进的成绩。然而，对于训练后数据的合成生成，我们的初步研究表明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42d11f496d28f99d",
      "translationZh": "与翻译常见的机器翻译测试集（例如 FLORES）相比，LLMs 在翻译 SFT 数据集时更容易产生幻觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f36ad9768a3f71de",
      "translationZh": "随着输入长度增加，开源 LLMs 的翻译质量显著下降，幻觉率显著上升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6206417d797c3949",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们引入了多种机制，以保持较高的翻译质量，并便于检测幻觉。概括如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "740d7442ed7ba486",
      "translationZh": "我们按换行符拆分句子，并逐行翻译。如果某一行无法翻译（例如，仅包含制表符）或属于代码块，则不予翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60b19d9720491e2c",
      "translationZh": "我们强制要求采用特定格式（“将译文包裹在括号 〘〙 中”），并使用这组特殊的配对括号提取译文。其他样例均被丢弃（见表 1）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae006cce5732b032",
      "translationZh": "我们对提示输入的译文运行 fastText 语言识别，以过滤掉非目标语言的数据点。我们又丢弃了 55,567 个样例（另占全部多语言样例的 1.1%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eea1972eb4eece9b",
      "translationZh": "表 1：通过强制要求输出格式而丢弃的数据比例（按字节计量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4fe65264ef7dbb3",
      "translationZh": "语言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5694d08a2e53ffca",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f3ef786b34d6dd7",
      "translationZh": "问答",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58a6d6801ae771e6",
      "translationZh": "数学",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0bc1e08f9743b2d",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ad8a7049d7c5511",
      "translationZh": "它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3702fc1866630796",
      "translationZh": "是的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12ee302284f173bd",
      "translationZh": "经过基准测试，我们选择了 Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct-AWQ（用于德语）和 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct（用于其他语言）来进行翻译。选择这些模型的考量包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fcf6bca57cdc0064",
      "translationZh": "稳定可靠的翻译质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ecde2e7af68dd29",
      "translationZh": "可在单张 A100 GPU 上运行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2628ddfcb46b4e6",
      "translationZh": "训练数据覆盖广泛领域",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be77c6cad65c3d14",
      "translationZh": "开放许可证（Apache 2.0）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ffa04c25b1059024",
      "translationZh": "如何使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31a71939d0e7bbd2",
      "translationZh": "👉 在此探索数据集：Hugging Face 数据集页面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
